- Removed V13.5 runtime layout block; no observer or polling added.

V13.5
- Fix strict 3x3 price layout by moving actual DOM fields, not visual-only CSS.
- Put listing quantity and single-product shipping on the same row in every room.
- Keep mother direct-listing media immediately after listing controls, then Variations.
- Remove failed V13.4 MutationObserver layout loop and duplicate delayed layout passes to improve one-click responsiveness.
- Preserve Premium/Starter Child inheritance, inline floor validation, 1 photo + 1 video, batch draft/publish.

Online Store V13.4
- Unified all room pricing cards into the agreed 3 x 3 order.
- Listing quantity and single-product shipping now share one row.
- VIP/Premium/Starter mother direct listing stays Qty 1; Random quantity remains editable with stock cap.
- Mother direct-listing media/workflow is followed by Variations.
- Premium/Starter Child can be added continuously without prior save and inherits mother price/dimensions.
- Each Child uses its own price, dimensions, one photo and one video; Child save/publish remains batch-based.
- Child price below Online protection floor shows an inline red warning and blocks save/publish.
- Removed .bak files from deployment package.

V13.3
