- Random “分配数量” renamed to “上架数量”.
- Random workflow now keeps exactly one status indicator.
- Random status colors: Published blue; Unpublished changes orange; Draft saved/updated green; Unpublish action red.

V13.3
- Removed duplicate Product Details / Care Guide blocks from Premium/Starter Child editors and the Random lower workflow area; Child and Random inherit mother content at listing time.
- Variations now default OFF when no explicit saved preference exists; VIP and Random remain Variations/Child disabled, while Premium/Starter can be enabled manually.
